        <h2 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white uppercase mb-8 leading-tight" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">STOP WATCHING.<br/>START RIDING.</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 justify-center">
          <button class="bg-[#FFC426] text-stone-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-lg font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest transition-all hover:scale-105" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">Book a Test Flight</button>
          <button class="border-2 border-white text-white px-12 py-5 rounded-lg font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest transition-all hover:bg-white hover:text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">Configure Yours</button>
        </div>
      </div>
